  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/03/IMG_7282.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(9 fotos) Una pareja de agentes de la Polic&iacute;a Local de Onda han visitado la ma&ntilde;ana de este viernes el centro de educaci&oacute;n infantil (CEI) El Trenet, en la avenida Montendre, 28, donde han departido y jugado con el peque&ntilde;o alumnado.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/policialocalvisitaceieltrenet/img_7274.jpg\" alt=\"img_7274\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/policialocalvisitaceieltrenet/img_7275.jpg\" alt=\"img_7275\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/policialocalvisitaceieltrenet/img_7277.jpg\" alt=\"img_7277\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/policialocalvisitaceieltrenet/img_7278.jpg\" alt=\"img_7278\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/policialocalvisitaceieltrenet/img_7279.jpg\" alt=\"img_7279\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/policialocalvisitaceieltrenet/img_7281.jpg\" alt=\"img_7281\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/policialocalvisitaceieltrenet/img_7285.jpg\" alt=\"img_7285\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/policialocalvisitaceieltrenet/img_7286.jpg\" alt=\"img_7286\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
